### baseUrl 변수
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### productId 변수
@productId = 1

### accessToken 변수
@accessToken =

### 상품 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 목록 조회 - 페이지네이션/검색
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?page=1&pageSize=10&keyword=맥북&orderBy=recent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 단건 상품 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "images": ["https://picsum.photos/seed/Roir5/1510/652?grayscale&blur=10"],
  "name": "맥북프로",
  "price": 3000000,
  "description": "테스트 상품 맥북입니다.",
  "tags": ["맥북", "노트북"]
}

### 상품 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "images": ["https://picsum.photos/seed/Roir5/1510/652?grayscale&blur=10"],
  "name": "맥북",
  "price": 3000000,
  "description": "상품 테스트 맥북입니다.",
  "tags": ["맥북", "노트북"]
}

### 상품 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 좋아요 추가
POST {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 좋아요 취소
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}/favorite
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 목록 조회 - items 별칭
GET {{baseUrl}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 단건 상품 조회 - items 별칭
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 상품 등록 - items 별칭
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "images": ["https://picsum.photos/seed/Roir5/1510/652?grayscale&blur=10"],
  "name": "아이템 별칭 맥북프로",
  "price": 3000000,
  "description": "items 별칭으로 테스트등록입니다.",
  "tags": ["맥북", "노트북"]
}
